stateDiagram-v2
    [*] --> Submitted
    Submitted --> Pending: proof delayed
    Submitted --> Confirmed: proof exists
    Submitted --> Failed: proof denied
    Pending --> Confirmed: downstream evidence arrives
    Pending --> ReviewRequired: risk/policy threshold
    Pending --> Failed: timeout or rejection
    ReviewRequired --> Confirmed: human approves
    ReviewRequired --> Failed: human rejects
    Confirmed --> [*]
    Failed --> [*]
